From ee025298f5f2af3be29ce1859e81f01bc5db4c54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rd-fork <rd-fork@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:33:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] 0002 P2 fail-closed BI disclosure envelope

For asset definitions with rd_disclosure = required, Shield, ZkTransfer and
Unshield are rejected unless they carry an RdEnvelopeV1 (spec 3.3-3.6): exact
parse, same asset, audit key version active at the current height (keys in the
rd_auditor account metadata rd_audit_keys), two ciphertexts of at least 17
bytes, binding = SHA-256 over this instruction's nullifiers, outputs, amount and
ciphertexts. Carrier: OpenVerifyEnvelope.aux, or tx metadata rd_envelope for
Shield (new StateTransaction.current_tx_metadata). Errors start with
rd-disclosure:. Other assets are unchanged.
